    "detailed_description": "Use your abilities to find lost modules and trade them for equipment, then traverse the lunar landscape while dealing with enemies corrupted by something beneath the surface...<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Survival, traversal and action gameplay.<br></li><li> A moody and atmospheric lunar setting.<br></li><li> A spherical level with a map and inventory system.<br></li><li> Delivery missions to earn extra credits for upgrades and equipment.<br></li><li> A global leaderboard entry of your final score, based on completed objectives and gameplay stats.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755240/extras/a497519150b801c0e2c199482e926ab3.poster.avif?t=1680716390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755240/extras/a497519150b801c0e2c199482e926ab3.webm?t=1680716390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1755240/extras/a497519150b801c0e2c199482e926ab3.mp4?t=1680716390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
